					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Julien"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732940501,
					"content": "What a simple camp... Paimon wonders if you could even call it a camp.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940502,
					"content": "Well, the scenery here is quite good, and there's a sense of openness whenever I stand by the water. It's honestly a lot more relaxing than when I was in Fontaine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940503,
					"content": "What sort of life did you lead while you were there, seriously? That's... not quite what Paimon was expecting from a renowned artist.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940504,
					"content": "I lived in a very small place back in Fontaine... And um, that's only because I'm a humble person.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940505,
					"content": "But even outdoor adventurer camps look way better than this. Huh? You have an animal buddy?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940506,
					"content": "Um, I don't have one. This must've been left behind by an adventurer or something like that. Speaking of which...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940507,
					"content": "I would love to receive you in better fashion, but most of my luggage fell into the water when my raft fell apart, and I cannot swim...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940508,
					"content": "But if you could find my lost luggage for me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940509,
					"content": "Would it even be usable after getting soaked like that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940510
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732940510,
					"content": "I did carefully pack everything up, but there are some things that... *sigh* Well, if I've lost them, I've lost them. I can always redraw them... yes, redraw them...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940511,
					"content": "Um, perhaps we should help out. This guy seems like he's in a real bad spot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732940512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732940512,
					"content": "I have no one else to rely on here, so I can only ask the two of you for aid. I'll be waiting here with some good tea in hand.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7329410,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7329410
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_AUTO",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7329410",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7329410,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Dog"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732941001,
					"content": "Strange. Why would there be a dog here? And it seems to be guarding something, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941002,
					"content": "(Watches you warily.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941003,
						732941005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941003,
					"content": "Smart doggie.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941004
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941004,
					"content": "(Gives a short bark.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941007,
					"content": "Right, didn't we see a food bowl back at Julien's camp? Maybe it belongs to this fella! Strange, though. Didn't Julien say that he didn't have any animal companions?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941008,
					"content": "*whimpers*",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941009,
					"content": "The dog runs toward the camp...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941010
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941010,
					"content": "It's gone... Let's ask Julien about this later. For now, though... Paimon wonders what's under this sand pile. Should we take a look?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941005,
					"content": "Where did this wild dog come from, anyway...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941006
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941006,
					"content": "(Gives a low growl.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7329412,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7329412
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7329412",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7329412,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Julien"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 732941201,
					"content": "We're back! Huh, so it is your animal companion, Julien!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941202,
					"content": "(Lets out a threatening growl.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941203,
					"content": "Wonderful, Pepper... Taken to growling at me, have you? Don't you know who's keeping us both fed here?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941204,
					"content": "(Oh, so it has a name! But on the other hand... is this guy seriously arguing with a dog?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941205,
						732941207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941205,
					"content": "(They seem to be really close.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941206
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941206,
					"content": "(Is that what \"close\" looks like to you!?)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941244,
					"content": "Hey, Julien! We found the stuff you lost! Pepper's your animal buddy, isn't it? Why did you lie to us earlier?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941209,
					"content": "If this ungrateful fellow counts as my buddy... I'd rather adopt a Rifthound.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941210,
					"content": "I doubt that you'll be companions for very long...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941211,
					"content": "Exactly. If someone like you, who faints from hunger, ran into a Rifthound, the resulting problem wouldn't be one we could solve with just a Teyvat Fried Egg...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941212,
					"content": "Speaking of which, it seems to have been guarding a drawing board on the beach.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941213,
						732941215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941213,
					"content": "It might have wanted to hide it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941214
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941214,
					"content": "Bad doggie!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941217,
					"content": "(Barks, seemingly in protest.)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dog"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941218,
					"content": "Are you seriously whining about this? If I hadn't followed you into this corner, I could've returned to Fontaine via my original path...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941219,
					"content": "Eh? Didn't you say that you ended up taking the waterways because you wanted to see the sights there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941220,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941221,
					"content": "Okay, fine... The truth is, I didn't even get to enjoy Sumeru's scenery — I just followed the dog and ended up in this place. The roads here point in all directions, so it was impossible to not get lost...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941222,
					"content": "Oh, so that's how it was. C'mon, you should have just told us the truth from the start! Why didn't you?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941223,
					"content": "Um... To... preserve the image of a renowned artist?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941224,
					"content": "Ugh, you sound like you're just trying to fake us out when you stammer like that, and you're not very good at it either!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941225,
					"content": "#But speaking of scenery here in Sumeru, {NICKNAME} and Paimon do happen to know some good spots. We can take you there.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941226,
					"content": "N—No need. Um, I mean... thanks for your offer, but I am a renowned artist, after all. Ultimately, I believe that worthwhile sceneries must be ones that we discover ourselves...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941227,
					"content": "Oh, and the tea's ready. Do you also happen to have more fried eggs? You know, as a little snack to go with the tea...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941228,
						732941230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941228,
					"content": "What an unusual combo.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941229
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941229,
					"content": "#Exactly! {NICKNAME}'s a master of many dishes! We can always have something else instead, hehe.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941232,
					"content": "You enjoy the tea together with some snacks.\\nThe tea's taste is hard to describe...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941233
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941233,
					"content": "Um, this tea...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941234,
					"content": "A friend of mine sold it to me. Apparently, it can activate the potential wisdom within you. I think it tastes great.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941235,
						732941237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941235,
					"content": "I'm glad I don't have any friends like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941236
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941236,
					"content": "How come? Having friends is a good thing. In fact, I came to Sumeru on a friend's recommendation as well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941240,
					"content": "Thank you both for what you've done for me today. I hope the compensation I prepared meets your expectations...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941241
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941241,
					"content": "It's fine, it's just... You sure you don't need our help in gathering inspiration? Paimon feels like you might get lost.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941242,
					"content": "The point of a pilgrimage... I mean, the point of a journey lies in walking it by oneself. I shouldn't trouble you two any further. I will undertake this myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941243,
					"content": "Well, sure, if you say so. Make sure you don't faint from hunger on the road again!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941237,
					"content": "Could you give me another cup?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941238,
					"content": "#You sure there's nothing wrong with your taste buds, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941239,
					"content": "Haha, not to be stingy or anything, but I'll still be in Sumeru for a while, so I need to save some for myself.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Julien"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941230,
					"content": "That sounds like wishful thinking to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941231
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941231,
					"content": "Hmm... But tea alone feels like it's missing something, you know? Let's just whip something up.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941232
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941215,
					"content": "It might have been protecting the drawing board from being stolen.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941216
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941216,
					"content": "But it ran off the moment we found it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 732941207,
					"content": "(I don't smell any wine...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941208
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 732941208,
					"content": "(Is he just usually like that? Seems like a rather troublesome guy...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						732941244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				}
			]
		}
	]
}